            "body": "> (First PR here, went through all guidelines.\r\n\r\nThanks, that is really appreciated.\r\n\r\nThis definitely is a nice UX improvement, but not sure it's worth the extra state + complexity. Any chance it can be simplified somehow, perhaps by checking existing state/options , e.g. `b:current_syntax` (not sure if that makes sense here, just reaching)",
